*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*7 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
