*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring a decent spammable midranger here and you should get through the stage fine. If you're worried you can burn a generalist or anti-Dark Uber here.

